    "body": "I think we already have the problem of strong references due to `FrozenArray` holding strong references. In https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/8545 @smaug---- felt most strongly about fixing this, but since then Gecko might also have shipped this \"leak\" or is about to?\r\n\r\nAs for the overall ask: I suspect WebKit would be okay with aligning here, but not necessarily willing to lead the charge.\r\n\r\ncc @rniwa ",
